{"metadata": {"team_id": "ucsc", "run_id": "UCSC-base-trained-MiniLM", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "2-2_11", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "The Okanagan Valley is a fantastic destination for wine tastings, often referred to as \"Napa North.\" You'll find close to 200 wineries that invite visitors for tours and tastings, often indicated by burgundy-colored grape signs on the roads.\n\nYou can explore the wineries by booking a wine tour service, or if you prefer to drive yourself, many vineyards are only a short distance apart. Most wineries offer tastings for under 10 CAD, which is often waived with a purchase. The region also hosts the annual Okanagan Fall Wine Festival, featuring special wine dinners and celebrations.\n\nSpecific wineries like Nk\u2019Mip Cellars offer unique experiences, such as the \"Four Food Chiefs pairing\" with Indigenous-inspired dishes. At Grey Monk Estate Winery, you can book a tasting in their Estate Room for $20 CAD, offering panoramic views of the lake and vineyard while sampling their white, ros\u00e9, and red wines. Many wineries also have excellent restaurants where you can enjoy wine flights with your meal, like at Old Vines at Quail's Gate.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:4": 0.9882221817970276, "clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:3": 0.9850414395332336, "clueweb22-en0019-67-07756:1": 0.9800570011138916, "clueweb22-en0026-89-01654:5": 0.9665891528129578, "clueweb22-en0020-37-07638:4": 0.9539638757705688, "clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:5": 0.9528117775917053, "clueweb22-en0019-67-07756:2": 0.9166779518127441, "clueweb22-en0017-92-09270:15": 0.906822919845581, "clueweb22-en0022-02-09272:6": 0.8312569856643677}, "ptkb_provenance": []}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:4": 0.9882221817970276, "clueweb22-en0004-57-15420:3": 0.9850414395332336, "clueweb22-en0019-67-07756:1": 0.9800570011138916, "clueweb22-en0026-89-01654:5": 0.9665891528129578, "clueweb22-en0037-64-16153:0": 0.9615858793258667, "clueweb22-en0020-37-0