{"metadata": {"team_id": "ucsc", "run_id": "UCSC-base-trained-MiniLM", "run_type": "automatic"}, "turn_id": "6-1_5", "responses": [{"rank": 1, "text": "Microneedling works by creating precise, microscopic punctures or \"micro-injuries\" in the skin's upper layers using a device with tiny needles. These controlled wounds trick your skin into thinking it's been injured, which triggers its natural wound-healing process.\n\nAs part of this healing, your body significantly increases the production of collagen and elastin\u2014the essential proteins that keep skin firm, smooth, and elastic. This new collagen helps to plump and smooth the skin, reducing the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, scars, and enlarged pores, while also improving overall skin texture and tone. Additionally, these tiny channels created by the needles allow for better absorption of beneficial skincare products applied afterward, enhancing their efficacy. The procedure is generally considered to have minimal downtime compared to more intense treatments.", "citations": {"clueweb22-en0017-43-06405:12": 0.9883516430854797, "clueweb22-en0040-85-11815:5": 0.9850478172302246, "clueweb22-en0038-11-18082:2": 0.982832133769989, "clueweb22-en0039-50-11586:17": 0.9819602966308594, "clueweb22-en0042-13-06743:2": 0.9780828952789307, "clueweb22-en0030-73-16433:1": 0.976440966129303, "clueweb22-en0042-04-19942:1": 0.9718785285949707, "clueweb22-en0000-42-05014:1": 0.9686481356620789, "clueweb22-en0025-75-16875:1": 0.9661305546760559, "clueweb22-en0031-76-08004:10": 0.9651967287063599, "clueweb22-en0038-11-18082:3": 0.9552257061004639, "clueweb22-en0041-58-07171:8": 0.9539113640785217}, "ptkb_provenance": []}], "references": {"clueweb22-en0033-70-02855:3": 0.9926570057868958, "clueweb22-en0006-25-14668:4": 0.9884645342826843, "clueweb22-en0017-43-06405:12": 0.9883516430854797, "clueweb22-en0040-85-11815:5": 0.9850478172302246, "clueweb22-en0038-11-18082:2": 0.982832133769989, "clueweb22-en0039-50-11586:17": 0.98196